VAR hasReadStatue = false

{hasReadStatue == false: 
<i>A grand statue stands upon the platform, its inscription glowing with importance</i>
<b>"Behold! The great and noble founder of this city...actually, wait, no. This is just a statue of some guy named Arthur. We're not sure who he was, but the sculptor really liked him."</b>
- else:
    "Dedicated to Arthur, who once won a staring contest against a goat. May his legacy live on."
}